    Translation{"Drop entries unused for a while", "按时间丢弃长期未用的条目"},
    Translation{"Edges come from manifests and local index descriptors; lockfile versions are shown when available. This is a declaration graph, not a resolved build graph. Dashed nodes have no local dependency metadata; conditional edges may not apply to this environment.", "关系来自项目清单和本地索引描述符；有锁定版本时显示锁定版本。这是声明关系图，不代表实际构建解析结果。虚线节点缺少本地依赖元数据，条件关系可能不适用于当前环境。"},
